name=Requiem of the Dead: Dragonfly
id=Dragonfly
modversion=1.0.0
require=RFTDCore
description=Dragonfly is the admin command center for the Requiem of the Dead mod family: a tabbed admin panel (default Shift+U keybind) with player management, live server state, an item editor, a console/log view, the Longstrider map and tour tools, and a coordinates HUD. Sibling RFTD mods register their own tabs and per-row actions into the panel when installed. Also includes a keybindable gate that hides admin/debug right-click options to declutter the context menu. Panel access is sandbox-tiered (Admin only by default). The Memoir journal, item BanBox, staff scoreboard/role tools, the sledgehammer anti-grief rule, and timed-action speed scaling now live in their own Requiem of the Dead mods. Requires Requiem of the Dead: Core (RFTDCore). Designed for dedicated multiplayer servers.
pzversion=42
